---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="AI Research, Consulting & Implementation | Latentsig AI"
  description="Explore Latentsig AI research and model engineering, consulting, and implementation services."
>
  <div class="services-page">
    <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="services-title">
      <div class="page-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">SERVICES / FROM QUESTION TO WORKING SYSTEM</p>
        <h1 id="services-title">The right kind of help, at the right stage.</h1>
        <p class="intro-copy">Explore research, technical guidance, and implementation with a clear next step for each.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="service-list page-inner" aria-label="Our services">
      <a class="service-card" href="/rd-advisory/" aria-labelledby="research-title">
        <div class="service-copy">
          <span class="card-number">01 / RESEARCH</span>
          <h2 id="research-title">Applied AI Research &amp; Model Engineering</h2>
          <p>Investigate model choices, adaptation, and evaluation before committing to a system design.</p>
          <span class="card-action">Explore R&amp;D advisory <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="service-visual research-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="visual-header"><span>RESEARCH WORKBENCH</span><span>MODEL STUDY / SAMPLE</span></div>
          <div class="research-flow">
            <div class="flow-block"><small>INPUT</small><strong>Task + data</strong><span>Constraints recorded</span></div>
            <div class="flow-connector"></div>
            <div class="flow-block active"><small>COMPARE</small><strong>Candidate approaches</strong><span>Evidence collected</span></div>
            <div class="flow-connector"></div>
            <div class="flow-block"><small>DECIDE</small><strong>Evaluation plan</strong><span>Trade-offs visible</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="visual-note"><span class="status-dot"></span> Research question → testable direction</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="service-card" href="/consulting/" aria-labelledby="consulting-title">
        <div class="service-copy">
          <span class="card-number">02 / GUIDANCE</span>
          <h2 id="consulting-title">AI Consulting</h2>
          <p>Get focused technical input on architecture, data, models, and the decisions between them.</p>
          <span class="card-action">Explore consulting <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="service-visual consulting-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="visual-header"><span>DECISION REVIEW</span><span>ARCHITECTURE / SAMPLE</span></div>
          <div class="decision-title">What should the next system do?</div>
          <div class="decision-row"><span class="decision-index">A</span><span>Define the workload</span><span class="decision-mark">✓</span></div>
          <div class="decision-row"><span class="decision-index">B</span><span>Compare constraints</span><span class="decision-mark">✓</span></div>
          <div class="decision-row selected"><span class="decision-index">C</span><span>Choose the next experiment</span><span class="decision-mark">↗</span></div>
          <div class="visual-note"><span class="status-dot"></span> A decision record teams can review</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="service-card" href="/implementation/" aria-labelledby="implementation-title">
        <div class="service-copy">
          <span class="card-number">03 / DELIVERY</span>
          <h2 id="implementation-title">AI Implementation</h2>
          <p>Turn a selected approach into a usable workflow with integration, review, and observability.</p>
          <span class="card-action">Explore implementation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="service-visual implementation-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="visual-header"><span>DELIVERY FLOW</span><span>SYSTEM VIEW / SAMPLE</span></div>
          <div class="delivery-flow">
            <div><small>01</small><strong>Connect</strong><span>Input and tools</span></div>
            <i></i>
            <div><small>02</small><strong>Review</strong><span>Human checkpoint</span></div>
            <i></i>
            <div><small>03</small><strong>Observe</strong><span>Visible result</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="visual-note"><span class="status-dot"></span> Implementation with inspectable steps</div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </section>

    <div class="closing page-inner">
      <p>Start with the problem you need to solve.</p>
      <a href="/contact/">Talk to our team <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .services-page{--page:#0b1326;--panel:#111c32;--line:rgba(191,195,234,.2);--ink:#edf1ff;--muted:#b3bfd6;--accent:#c0c1ff;background:var(--page);color:var(--ink);font-family:Geist,system-ui,sans-serif}
  .page-inner{width:min(1260px,calc(100% - 48px));margin-inline:auto}
  .intro{padding:112px 0 76px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 0%,rgba(127,133,220,.18),transparent 55%)}
  .eyebrow,.card-number,.visual-header,.visual-note,.flow-block small,.delivery-flow small{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.13em}
  .eyebrow{color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 28px}
  h1,h2,p{margin-top:0}
  h1{max-width:900px;font:550 clamp(2.9rem,6vw,5.7rem)/1.03 'Hanken Grotesk',Geist,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin-bottom:24px}
  .intro-copy{max-width:610px;color:var(--muted);font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.7vw,1.25rem);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:0}
  .service-list{display:grid;gap:22px;padding-bottom:104px}
  .service-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.8fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(28px,5vw,80px);align-items:center;min-height:390px;padding:clamp(28px,4vw,54px);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(125deg,rgba(23,32,53,.98),rgba(15,24,43,.98));color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .22s ease,border-color .22s ease,box-shadow .22s ease}
  .service-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:rgba(192,193,255,.55);box-shadow:0 22px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.16)}
  .service-card:focus-visible,.closing a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #c0c1ff;outline-offset:4px}
  .service-copy{min-width:0}
  .card-number{display:block;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:22px}
  h2{font:550 clamp(2rem,3.2vw,3.2rem)/1.13 'Hanken Grotesk',Geist,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-bottom:18px}
  .service-copy p{max-width:480px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:32px}
  .card-action{display:inline-flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;color:var(--accent);font-weight:650;font-size:.94rem}
  .card-action span,.closing a span{font-size:1.15rem;transition:transform .2s}
  .service-card:hover .card-action span,.closing a:hover span{transform:translate(2px,-2px)}
  .service-visual{min-width:0;min-height:270px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:24px;border:1px solid rgba(197,203,246,.22);border-radius:15px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 72% 0%,rgba(132,139,231,.15),transparent 60%),#0b1428;box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(0,0,0,.12);overflow:hidden}
  .visual-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;color:#9ba6c2;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:14px;white-space:nowrap}
  .visual-header span:last-child{color:#777f9e}
  .research-flow,.delivery-flow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex:1;padding:23px 0}
  .flow-block{flex:1;min-width:0;min-height:140px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:17px 14px;border:1px solid rgba(191,195,234,.2);border-radius:10px;background:#17223a}
  .flow-block.active{border-color:rgba(192,193,255,.7);background:#20294c}
  .flow-block small{color:#9da6c5}
  .flow-block strong,.delivery-flow strong{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.3}
  .flow-block span,.delivery-flow span{color:#9da8bf;font-size:.73rem;line-height:1.3}
  .flow-connector{flex:0 0 18px;height:1px;background:#979cdc}
  .visual-note{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;color:#a9b5ce;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:13px;letter-spacing:.03em}
  .status-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#c0c1ff;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(192,193,255,.7)}
  .decision-title{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:650;margin:22px 0 15px}
  .decision-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr 20px;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:42px;padding:6px 10px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.83rem}
  .decision-row.selected{background:rgba(192,193,255,.11);border:1px solid rgba(192,193,255,.42);border-radius:7px}
  .decision-index,.decision-mark{color:#aeb5ff;font-weight:650}
  .decision-mark{text-align:right}
  .consulting-visual .visual-note{margin-top:auto}
  .delivery-flow>div{flex:1;min-width:0;min-height:142px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:17px 13px;border:1px solid rgba(191,195,234,.2);border-radius:10px;background:#17223a}
  .delivery-flow>div:nth-of-type(2){border-color:rgba(192,193,255,.7);background:#20294c}
  .delivery-flow small{color:#aeb4ff}
  .delivery-flow i{width:14px;height:1px;flex:none;background:#979cdc}
  .closing{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:22px;padding-top:30px;padding-bottom:90px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .closing p{font:500 clamp(1.45rem,2.6vw,2.3rem)/1.25 'Hanken Grotesk',Geist,sans-serif;margin:0}
  .closing a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;white-space:nowrap;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:8px;background:#c0c1ff;color:#171b3d;text-decoration:none;font-weight:650}
  @media(max-width:900px){.service-card{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}.service-visual{min-height:250px}.intro{padding-top:80px}.service-list{padding-bottom:75px}}
  @media(max-width:580px){.page-inner{width:calc(100% - 36px)}.intro{padding:70px 0 55px}.service-card{padding:22px;border-radius:17px;min-height:0}.service-visual{padding:17px;min-height:232px}.visual-header{font-size:.54rem}.flow-block{min-height:125px;padding:12px 8px}.flow-block strong,.delivery-flow strong{font-size:.72rem}.flow-block span,.delivery-flow span{font-size:.59rem}.flow-connector,.delivery-flow i{flex-basis:8px}.research-flow,.delivery-flow{gap:5px}.delivery-flow>div{min-height:125px;padding:12px 8px}.closing{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;padding-bottom:65px}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.service-card,.card-action span,.closing a span{transition:none}.service-card:hover{transform:none}}
</style>
